data: {"id": "b8ca780039cd402b-thinking-parallel_evidence-1850", "run_id": "b8ca780039cd402b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "最新结果显示 Pod 仍为 Terminating，但 YAML 中 phase=Running，status 字段=Terminating。deletionTimestamp 为 `2026-09-14T07:21:42Z`，deletionGracePeriodSeconds=3900（65分钟），terminationGracePeriodSeconds=3900。\n\n现在结合已完成的 Metrics 结果做最终结论判断。\n\n---\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 当前状态（Kubernetes 实时）\n- **Pod 名称**: aiops-case-v12/workload\n- **Pod UID**: 92291ca4-5ad3-454a-92df-63204d28d8f2\n- **nodeName**: node2\n- **STATUS**: `Terminating`\n- **phase**: `Running`\n- **deletionTimestamp**: `2026-09-14T07:21:42Z`\n- **terminationGracePerio", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789366676552, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

